  "description": "Han Si-woo, a BL novelist, enrols in a Pilates class to build up his stamina, which has been weakened by his work.\n\nThere, he meets his instructor, Yeon-jun, and works hard to improve both his fitness and his love life.\n\nOne day, after suffering from persistent stalking, Si-woo receives help from Yeon-jun and finds himself relying on him even more...\n\nBut there’s something off about Yeon-jun’s smile?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/feel_and_love), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/feelandlove)",
